            <h3 class="panel-title">Impeeza Crew</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
            <p>
            Do you want to be a Rover Scout? If you are having trouble finding a crew to join, fret not.
            </p>
            <p>
            The Impeeza Rover Crew is based at the Singapore Scouts Association Headquarters in Bishan. It is open to all interested youths, regardless of previous scouting experience, etc. Please contact the National Rover Council at <a href="mailto:sgnationalrovercouncil@gmail.com">sgnationalrovercouncil@gmail.com</a> with an email explaining your situation so we can link you up with them.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div> <!-- /.panel -->
